    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the firm's must ensure compliance with relevant regulatory requirements such as GDPR and personal data protection laws. our platform design and hosting options can be configured to meet these requirements, but careful planning and monitoring will be necessary to ensure ongoing compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by leveraging our platformorm and our platform various components, integrating with the firm's production tools and user directory, and utilizing the firm's high-availability hosting options, the firm's can design an architecture that meets the technical requirements outlined." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, careful attention must be paid to potential risks and challenges associated with data sovereignty, security, and regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, with no leakage of data between client files acceptable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must comply with the GDPR, hosting data within the EU with no transfer outside the EU, and protecting sensitive data through encryption or pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that we solution meets these security and compliance requirements, and what measures can we take to guarantee the reliability and traceability of outputs? we can ensure that our solution meets the client's security and compliance requirements by leveraging we existing certifications and data protection measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As an ISO 27001 certified company since 2023, with a scope covering Development, delivery and operations, we have a robust framework for managing sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we ISO 27701 certification provides assurance for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To prevent leakage of data between client files, we implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, along with access controls that prevent any cross-client circulation of data. we data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, as well as key management through we the EU-based infrastructure. we also comply with the GDPR, as evidenced by we experience in delivering solutions to clients bound by professional secrecy, including a national professional order. we familiarity with statutory audit principles, such as auditor independence and separation of duties, further ensures that we can meet the client's requirements for reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee the reliability and traceability of outputs, we provide logging of access and every system output through we audit logging capabilities. logging of access and every system output through our audit logging capabilities, combined with we control mapping which links platform features to applicable obligations and allows for the production of corresponding audit evidence, ensures that all outputs are grounded in and traceable to a source document." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we hosting partner is OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification, we can ensure that data is hosted within the EU, with no transfer outside the EU, thus meeting the sovereignty constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup supports sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU, aligning with the client's requirements for data protection and compliance with regulations such as the GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we existing certifications, data protection measures, and experience in managing sensitive information provide a solid foundation for ensuring the security, compliance, reliability, and traceability of our solution, meeting the client's stringent requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client is a regional accounting and statutory-audit firm operating in the EU, with around 250 staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must comply with various regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, professional secrecy and confidentiality, anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key legal risks associated with The solution, and how can we ensure that we approach is compliant with all relevant regulations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Legal Agent of The client, I have reviewed The client company context to identify potential key legal risks associated with The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client requirements and constraints, some key legal risks include non-compliance with GDPR, breaches of professional secrecy and confidentiality, failure to meet anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT), and non-adherence to legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate some key legal risks, our approach should ensure compliance with the relevant regulatory frameworks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As per our company context, The client are familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy and have experience working with private firms, regulated professions, and public-sector clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also have a Security & Compliance function that maintains regulatory compliance, including GDPR, professional secrecy, anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT), and legal retention obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client should ensure that The client contractual framework does not compromise The client professional obligations or those of The client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has administrative attestations available, which can provide assurance regarding The client compliance with social and fiscal obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, The client have experience with private consultation terms, including service levels, penalties, reversibility, audit rights, and confidentiality undertakings." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection, our company context states that the client retains full ownership of the client own documents, ingested corpus, and produced data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client provide for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract, which aligns with GDPR requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's IP model is based on proprietary software licensed to the client under a subscription/usage model, and The client use permissive licenses for open-source components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance, The client should conduct a thorough review of the client's specific regulatory requirements and adapt The client approach accordingly. adapt may involve collaborating with the client's legal and compliance teams to identify potential risks and implement measures to mitigate potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By taking a proactive and compliant approach, The client can minimize the key legal risks associated with this project and ensure a successful outcome for both parties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget allocated to the project is €220,000 over 3 years, with an expectation of controlled annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the firm is an SME, the titleholder must propose an approach that optimizes costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the firm cost structures and pricing models, and how can the firm ensure that the firm proposal meets the client's budgetary expectations? the firm annual revenue is €6,200,000 with a near break-even result, indicating that the firm have a good handle on the firm costs. the firm have a Series A funding of €12,000,000 which provides the firm with a comfortable cash runway. the firm daily rates for various roles are well-defined, ranging from €700 for an engineer to €1,300 for a project director." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of cost structure, the firm have one-off project costs such as framing, design, integration, change management, and training, as well as recurring run costs including platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The main recurring cost drivers are hosting and inference, which vary depending on the chosen tier and model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's budget of €220,000 over 3 years, the firm approach should focus on optimizing costs while delivering the expected quality of service. the firm can achieve focus by proposing a cost-efficient configuration that balances the needs of the project with the firm pricing model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the firm financial capacity note indicates, an engagement of €220,000 over 3 years is well within the firm normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, the firm can confidently propose a solution that meets the client's budgetary expectations while ensuring the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, the firm may consider proposing the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, which is the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side. the firm should also ensure that the firm proposal includes a clear breakdown of one-off project costs and recurring run costs, with a focus on controlling annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, the firm can demonstrate to the client that our proposal is tailored to the client budgetary expectations while delivering the required quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the firm's professionals' work environment, supporting the firm's professionals' in the firm's professionals' daily activities. provide may include retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, assistance in drafting professional documents, support in handling client files, and support for the continuity of missions between collaborators." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI technologies and innovations can we leverage to meet these requirements, and how can we ensure that we solution is non-decisional and respectful of professional secrecy and auditor independence?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, can leverage retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to provide an intelligent assistance tool. retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities allows every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, citing passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus rather than relying on a model's parametric memory." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
